eople-hostile \"features\", developed and maintained by humans.","submitter_user":"iandavis","user_is_author":false,"tags":["browsers"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/s78pit","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/s78pit/basebrowserproject"},{"short_id":"vnfk4x","created_at":"2026-07-29T09:40:24.721-05:00","title":"xy is very fast and customizable charting library for Python","url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/xy","score":1,"flags":1,"comment_count":0,"description":"\u003cp\u003eSharing this Python plotting lib, hope it is useful. The main selling point is that it's super fast and performant, e.g. can do 10-billion-point OpenStreetMap dataset. Apache 2.0 license.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you're already using matplotlib, should be able to just change the import to get improved performance \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/reflex-dev/xy/blob/main/spec/matplotlib/compat.md\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003efor a lot of things\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt supports styling with CSS. There are some pretty impressive demos on the docs page: \u003ca href=\"https://reflex-staging.dev/docs/xy/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://reflex-staging.dev/docs/xy/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisclosure: One of the devs is my friend.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Sharing this Python plotting lib, hope it is useful. The main selling point is that it's super fast and performant, e.g. can do 10-billion-point OpenStreetMap dataset. Apache 2.0 license.\r\n\r\nIf you're already using matplotlib, should be able to just change the import to get improved performance [for a lot of things](https://github.com/reflex-dev/xy/blob/main/spec/matplotlib/compat.md).\r\n\r\nIt supports styling with CSS. There are some pretty impressive demos on the docs page: https://reflex-staging.dev/docs/xy/\r\n\r\nDisclosure: One of the devs is my friend.","submitter_user":"ig","user_is_author":false,"tags":["python","vibecoding"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/vnfk4x","comments_url":"h